The ablations stay close to \condAgenticCogWriter\ on native scores, while \condSingleWriter\ has the highest WritingBench native mean and the lowest WritingBench fidelity mean.
Raw rubric means cluster near the top of the 1--5 scale, which motivates z-scoring each dimension within benchmark for the pointwise composite.
